{
  "sourceLanguage": "en",
  "strings": {
    "%lld photos saved and signed.": {
      "comment": "Shown after an exposure bracket: each frame was added to the photo library as its own photo, each with a Content Credentials signature. The number is the count of photos, at least 3. Honesty wording: says only that they were saved and signed.",
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "%lld Fotos gesichert und signiert."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "%lld fotos guardadas y firmadas."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "%lld photos enregistrées et signées."
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "%lld foto salvate e firmate."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "%lld 枚の写真を保存し、署名しました。"
          }
        },
        "ko": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "사진 %lld장을 저장하고 서명했습니다."
          }
        },
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "%lld foto’s bewaard en ondertekend."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "%lld fotos salvas e assinadas."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "已保存并签名 %lld 张照片。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "已儲存並簽署 %lld 張照片。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A photo can't be opened or shown correctly without these. None of them identify you or link your photos.": {
      "comment": "Explains why the locked details are always saved. Must not claim more than the English. Honesty wording: a fluent human must review every translation before release.",
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "Ohne diese Angaben lässt sich ein Foto nicht öffnen oder richtig anzeigen. Keine davon identifiziert dich oder verknüpft deine Fotos."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "Sin estos datos, una foto no se puede abrir ni mostrar correctamente. Ninguno te identifica ni vincula tus fotos."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "Sans eux, une photo ne peut pas être ouverte ni affichée correctement. Aucun ne vous identifie ni ne relie vos photos."
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "Senza questi dati una foto non può essere aperta né mostrata correttamente. Nessuno di essi ti identifica o collega le tue foto."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "これらがないと、写真を開いたり正しく表示したりできません。いずれもあなたを特定したり、写真同士を結び付けたりしません。"
          }
        },
        "ko": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "이 정보가 없으면 사진을 열거나 올바르게 표시할 수 없습니다. 어느 것도 사용자를 식별하거나 사진을 서로 연결하지 않습니다."
          }
        },
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "Zonder deze gegevens kan een foto niet worden geopend of correct worden weergegeven. Geen ervan identificeert jou of koppelt je foto’s."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "Sem eles, a foto não pode ser aberta nem exibida corretamente. Nenhum deles identifica você ou vincula suas fotos."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "缺少这些信息，照片就无法打开或正确显示。这些信息都不会识别你的身份，也不会关联你的照片。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "缺少這些資訊，照片就無法開啟或正確顯示。這些資訊都不會識別你的身分，也不會連結你的照片。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A second photo, started %@ after nope.'s, with the processing iOS applies when an app asks for the highest quality. It may combine several frames, and it may differ from what other camera apps save.": {
      "comment": "Compare view: what the phone-processed side is. The value is a time such as 850 ms. Keep \"nope.\" unchanged. Must not claim more than the English.",
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "Ein zweites Foto, %@ nach dem von nope. begonnen, mit der Verarbeitung, die iOS anwendet, wenn eine App die höchste Qualität anfordert. Es kann mehrere Einzelbilder kombinieren und von dem abweichen, was andere Kamera-Apps sichern."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "Una segunda foto, iniciada %@ después de la de nope., con el procesado que aplica iOS cuando una app pide la máxima calidad. Puede combinar varios fotogramas y puede diferir de lo que guardan otras apps de cámara."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "Une seconde photo, lancée %@ après celle de nope., avec le traitement qu’iOS applique quand une app demande la meilleure qualité. Elle peut combiner plusieurs images et peut différer de ce qu’enregistrent d’autres apps d’appareil photo."
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "Una seconda foto, avviata %@ dopo quella di nope., con l’elaborazione che iOS applica quando un’app chiede la qualità più alta. Può combinare più fotogrammi e può differire da ciò che salvano altre app fotocamera."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "nope. の写真の %@ 後に開始した2枚目の写真で、アプリが最高画質を要求したときに iOS が適用する処理が施されています。複数のフレームを合成することがあり、ほかのカメラアプリが保存するものとは異なる場合があります。"
          }
        },
        "ko": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "nope. 사진보다 %@ 후에 시작된 두 번째 사진으로, 앱이 최고 품질을 요청할 때 iOS가 적용하는 처리를 거쳤습니다. 여러 프레임을 합칠 수 있으며, 다른 카메라 앱이 저장하는 것과 다를 수 있습니다."
          }
        },
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "Een tweede foto, %@ na die van nope. gestart, met de verwerking die iOS toepast wanneer een app om de hoogste kwaliteit vraagt. Ze kan meerdere beelden combineren en kan verschillen van wat andere camera-apps bewaren."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "Uma segunda foto, iniciada %@ depois da do nope., com o processamento que o iOS aplica quando um app pede a qualidade mais alta. Ela pode combinar vários quadros e pode ser diferente do que outros apps de câmera salvam."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "第二张照片，在 nope. 照片之后 %@ 开始拍摄，使用 iOS 在 App 请求最高质量时所应用的处理。它可能合成多帧，也可能与其他相机 App 存储的照片不同。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "第二張照片，在 nope. 照片之後 %@ 開始拍攝，使用 iOS 在 App 要求最高品質時所套用的處理。它可能合成多個影格，也可能與其他相機 App 儲存的照片不同。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
