    "Each frame is a separate single-frame photo. Nothing is merged.": {
      "comment": "Explains exposure bracketing. Must not claim more than the English: the photos are never combined.",
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "Jedes Bild ist ein eigenes Einzelbildfoto. Nichts wird zusammengeführt."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "Cada fotograma es una foto independiente de un solo fotograma. No se combina nada."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "Chaque image est une photo distincte à image unique. Rien n’est fusionné."
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "Ogni fotogramma è una foto separata a fotogramma singolo. Nulla viene unito."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "各フレームは個別の単一フレーム写真です。合成は行いません。"
          }
        },
        "ko": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "각 프레임은 별도의 단일 프레임 사진입니다. 합치지 않습니다."
          }
        },
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "Elk beeld is een aparte foto van één beeld. Er wordt niets samengevoegd."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "Cada quadro é uma foto separada de quadro único. Nada é mesclado."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "每一帧都是独立的单帧照片，不会合并。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "每一幀都是獨立的單幀照片，不會合併。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Each photo is one frame from the sensor, saved as RAW with as little processing as this phone allows. HEIF and JPEG copies are developed from it.": {
      "comment": "Explains the format chip on the camera. RAW, HEIF and JPEG are file format names. Must not claim more than the English: as little processing as the phone allows, not zero. Honesty wording: a fluent human must review every translation before release.",
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "Jedes Foto ist ein einzelnes Bild vom Sensor, als RAW gesichert mit so wenig Verarbeitung, wie dieses Telefon zulässt. HEIF- und JPEG-Kopien werden daraus entwickelt."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "Cada foto es un único fotograma del sensor, guardado como RAW con el menor procesamiento que permite este teléfono. Las copias HEIF y JPEG se revelan a partir de él."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "Chaque photo est une seule image du capteur, enregistrée en RAW avec aussi peu de traitement que ce téléphone le permet. Les copies HEIF et JPEG sont développées à partir de celle-ci."
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "Ogni foto è un singolo fotogramma del sensore, salvato come RAW con la minima elaborazione consentita da questo telefono. Le copie HEIF e JPEG vengono sviluppate da esso."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "各写真はセンサーからの1フレームで、この電話で可能な限り処理の少ないRAWとして保存されます。HEIFとJPEGのコピーはそこから現像されます。"
          }
        },
        "ko": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "각 사진은 센서에서 얻은 한 프레임으로, 이 휴대폰이 허용하는 한 최소한의 처리만 거친 RAW로 저장됩니다. HEIF 및 JPEG 사본은 이를 바탕으로 현상됩니다."
          }
        },
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "Elke foto is één beeld van de sensor, bewaard als RAW met zo weinig bewerking als deze telefoon toelaat. HEIF- en JPEG-kopieën worden ervan ontwikkeld."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "Cada foto é um único quadro do sensor, salvo como RAW com o mínimo de processamento que este telefone permite. As cópias HEIF e JPEG são reveladas a partir dele."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "每张照片都是传感器的单帧，以本机允许的最低处理程度存储为 RAW。HEIF 和 JPEG 副本由它冲印而成。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "每張照片都是感光元件的單一影格，以本機允許的最低處理程度儲存為 RAW。HEIF 和 JPEG 副本由它沖印而成。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Each photo is separate. Nothing is combined. Keep nope. open while the series runs.": {
      "comment": "Explains interval shooting. Keep \"nope.\" unchanged: it is the app's name. Must not claim more than the English.",
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "Jedes Foto ist eigenständig. Nichts wird kombiniert. Lass nope. geöffnet, solange die Serie läuft."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "Cada foto es independiente. No se combina nada. Mantén nope. abierta mientras dure la serie."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "Chaque photo est distincte. Rien n’est combiné. Gardez nope. ouverte pendant la série."
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "Ogni foto è separata. Nulla viene combinato. Tieni nope. aperta mentre la serie è in corso."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "各写真は個別です。合成は行いません。撮影中は nope. を開いたままにしてください。"
          }
        },
        "ko": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "각 사진은 별개입니다. 합치지 않습니다. 촬영이 끝날 때까지 nope.를 열어 두십시오."
          }
        },
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "Elke foto is apart. Er wordt niets gecombineerd. Houd nope. open zolang de reeks loopt."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "Cada foto é separada. Nada é combinado. Mantenha o nope. aberto enquanto a série durar."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "每张照片都是独立的，不会合并。拍摄期间请保持 nope. 打开。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "每張照片都是獨立的，不會合併。拍攝期間請保持 nope. 開啟。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Each photo is signed, so changes can be detected.": {
      "comment": "First-run statement 2 of 3: photos get a Content Credentials signature (on by default). Must not claim more than the English: the signature shows changes, it doesn't prove who took the photo. Honesty wording: a fluent human must review every translation before release.",
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "Jedes Foto wird signiert, damit Änderungen erkannt werden können."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "Cada foto se firma, para que se puedan detectar los cambios."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "Chaque photo est signée, pour que les modifications puissent être détectées."
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "Ogni foto è firmata, così le modifiche possono essere rilevate."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "各写真に署名するので、変更を検出できます。"
          }
        },
        "ko": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "모든 사진에 서명하므로 변경 사항을 감지할 수 있습니다."
          }
        },
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "Elke foto wordt ondertekend, zodat wijzigingen kunnen worden opgemerkt."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "Cada foto é assinada, para que alterações possam ser detectadas."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "每张照片都会签名，因此可以检测到更改。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "每張照片都會簽署，因此可以偵測到變更。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
