    "Lets anyone check that the photo hasn't changed since nope. saved it. If off, the photo can't be checked for changes.": {
      "comment": "Explains the signing switch. Keep \"nope.\" unchanged. Must not claim more than the English: the signature shows changes, it doesn't prove who took the photo. Honesty wording: a fluent human must review every translation before release.",
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "Damit kann jeder prüfen, dass das Foto seit dem Sichern durch nope. nicht verändert wurde. Wenn aus, lässt sich nicht prüfen, ob das Foto verändert wurde."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "Permite a cualquiera comprobar que la foto no ha cambiado desde que nope. la guardó. Si se desactiva, no se puede comprobar si la foto ha cambiado."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "Permet à chacun de vérifier que la photo n’a pas changé depuis que nope. l’a enregistrée. Désactivé, on ne peut pas vérifier si la photo a changé."
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "Consente a chiunque di verificare che la foto non sia cambiata da quando nope. l’ha salvata. Se disattivato, non è possibile verificare se la foto è cambiata."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "nope. が保存してから写真が変更されていないことを、誰でも確認できます。オフにすると、変更の有無を確認できません。"
          }
        },
        "ko": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "nope.가 저장한 이후 사진이 변경되지 않았는지 누구나 확인할 수 있습니다. 끄면 사진의 변경 여부를 확인할 수 없습니다."
          }
        },
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "Iedereen kan controleren dat de foto niet is veranderd sinds nope. hem bewaarde. Als dit uit staat, kan niet worden gecontroleerd of de foto is veranderd."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "Permite que qualquer pessoa verifique se a foto não mudou desde que o nope. a salvou. Se desativado, não é possível verificar se a foto mudou."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "让任何人都能确认照片自 nope. 存储后未被更改。关闭后，就无法检查照片是否被更改。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "讓任何人都能確認照片自 nope. 儲存後未經更改。關閉後，就無法檢查照片是否經過更改。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Live aids are measured on the preview, a few times a second, only while they show. Nothing is saved.": {
      "comment": "Note under the focus peaking, histogram and live readout switches. Must not claim more than the English.",
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "Live-Hilfen werden nur, solange sie angezeigt werden, ein paar Mal pro Sekunde an der Vorschau gemessen. Nichts wird gespeichert."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "Las ayudas en directo se miden en la vista previa, unas pocas veces por segundo y solo mientras se muestran. No se guarda nada."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "Les aides en direct sont mesurées sur l’aperçu, quelques fois par seconde, uniquement quand elles sont affichées. Rien n’est enregistré."
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "Gli aiuti in tempo reale vengono misurati sull’anteprima, poche volte al secondo, solo mentre sono visibili. Non viene salvato nulla."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "ライブ補助は表示中だけ、1秒に数回プレビューで測定します。何も保存されません。"
          }
        },
        "ko": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "실시간 보조는 표시되는 동안에만 미리보기에서 초당 몇 번 측정합니다. 아무것도 저장되지 않습니다."
          }
        },
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "Live hulpmiddelen worden alleen zolang ze zichtbaar zijn een paar keer per seconde op de voorvertoning gemeten. Er wordt niets bewaard."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "Os auxílios ao vivo são medidos na pré-visualização, algumas vezes por segundo, só enquanto aparecem. Nada é salvo."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "实时辅助仅在显示时于预览画面上每秒测量几次，不会存储任何内容。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "即時輔助只在顯示時於預覽畫面上每秒測量幾次，不會儲存任何內容。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
