    "New photos include where they were taken: latitude, longitude and altitude. You can turn Location off under Choose Details in Settings.": {
      "comment": "Explanation of the Location On chip on the camera: new photos include their location. Choose Details is the name of nope.'s own settings screen; use its translation. Must not claim more than the English.",
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "Neue Fotos enthalten, wo sie aufgenommen wurden: Breitengrad, Längengrad und Höhe. Du kannst Standort in den Einstellungen unter „Details auswählen“ ausschalten."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "Las fotos nuevas incluyen dónde se tomaron: latitud, longitud y altitud. Puedes desactivar Ubicación en Ajustes, en Elegir detalles."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "Les nouvelles photos indiquent où elles ont été prises : latitude, longitude et altitude. Vous pouvez désactiver Position dans les réglages, sous Choisir les détails."
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "Le nuove foto includono dove sono state scattate: latitudine, longitudine e altitudine. Puoi disattivare Posizione nelle impostazioni, in Scegli i dettagli."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "新しい写真には撮影場所（緯度、経度、高度）が含まれます。位置情報は設定の「詳細を選択」でオフにできます。"
          }
        },
        "ko": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "새 사진에는 촬영 위치(위도, 경도, 고도)가 포함됩니다. 설정의 세부 정보 선택에서 위치를 끌 수 있습니다."
          }
        },
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "Nieuwe foto’s bevatten waar ze zijn gemaakt: breedtegraad, lengtegraad en hoogte. Je kunt Locatie uitzetten in de instellingen onder Kies details."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "As novas fotos incluem onde foram tiradas: latitude, longitude e altitude. Você pode desativar Localização nos ajustes, em Escolher detalhes."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "新照片会包含拍摄地点：纬度、经度和海拔。你可以在设置的“选择详细信息”中关闭位置。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
