    "Shown with the manual controls. It measures the processed live preview, not the RAW.": {
      "comment": "Explains the Histogram switch. RAW is a file format name. Must not claim more than the English.",
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "Wird mit den manuellen Einstellungen angezeigt. Es misst die verarbeitete Live-Vorschau, nicht das RAW."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "Se muestra con los controles manuales. Mide la vista previa en directo procesada, no el RAW."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "Affiché avec les réglages manuels. Il mesure l’aperçu en direct traité, pas le RAW."
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "Visibile con i controlli manuali. Misura l’anteprima in tempo reale elaborata, non il RAW."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "マニュアル操作と一緒に表示されます。RAWではなく、処理済みのライブプレビューを測定します。"
          }
        },
        "ko": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "수동 조절과 함께 표시됩니다. RAW가 아니라 처리된 실시간 미리보기를 측정합니다."
          }
        },
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "Zichtbaar bij de handmatige regelaars. Het meet de bewerkte live voorvertoning, niet de RAW."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "Aparece com os controles manuais. Mede a pré-visualização ao vivo processada, não o RAW."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "与手动控制一起显示。测量的是已处理的实时预览，而不是 RAW。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "與手動控制項一起顯示。測量的是已處理的即時預覽，而不是 RAW。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Shutter speed, ISO, aperture and focal length. Off: you can't see later how the photo was taken.": {
      "comment": "What the exposure settings are, and what turning them off costs. Honesty wording: a fluent human must review every translation before release.",
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "Verschlusszeit, ISO, Blende und Brennweite. Aus: Du kannst später nicht sehen, wie das Foto aufgenommen wurde."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "Velocidad de obturación, ISO, apertura y distancia focal. Desactivado: no podrás ver después cómo se tomó la foto."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "Vitesse d’obturation, ISO, ouverture et focale. Désactivé : vous ne pourrez pas voir plus tard comment la photo a été prise."
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "Tempo di scatto, ISO, apertura e lunghezza focale. Disattivo: in seguito non potrai vedere come è stata scattata la foto."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "シャッタースピード、ISO、絞り、焦点距離。オフ：あとから撮影時の設定を確認できません。"
          }
        },
        "ko": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "셔터 속도, ISO, 조리개 및 초점 거리. 끔: 나중에 사진을 어떻게 촬영했는지 확인할 수 없습니다."
          }
        },
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "Sluitertijd, ISO, diafragma en brandpuntsafstand. Uit: je kunt later niet zien hoe de foto is gemaakt."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "Velocidade do obturador, ISO, abertura e distância focal. Desativado: você não poderá ver depois como a foto foi capturada."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "快门速度、ISO、光圈和焦距。关闭：之后无法查看照片的拍摄方式。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "快門速度、ISO、光圈與焦距。關閉：之後無法查看照片的拍攝方式。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
