    "iOS may detect faces in the viewfinder to decide where to focus. nope. doesn't read or save which faces it found.": {
      "comment": "Claim 18 in docs/research/privacy-claims.md (AVCaptureDevice face-driven autofocus, on by default). Keep \"nope.\" unchanged. Must not claim more than the English.",
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "iOS erkennt im Sucher möglicherweise Gesichter, um zu entscheiden, worauf scharfgestellt wird. nope. liest oder speichert nicht, welche Gesichter erkannt wurden."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "Es posible que iOS detecte caras en el visor para decidir dónde enfocar. nope. no lee ni guarda qué caras ha encontrado."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "iOS peut détecter des visages dans le viseur pour choisir où faire la mise au point. nope. ne lit ni n’enregistre les visages trouvés."
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "iOS può rilevare i volti nel mirino per decidere dove mettere a fuoco. nope. non legge né salva quali volti ha trovato."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "iOSはピントを合わせる位置を決めるために、ビューファインダー内の顔を検出することがあります。nope.は検出された顔の情報を読み取ったり保存したりしません。"
          }
        },
        "ko": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "iOS는 초점을 맞출 위치를 정하기 위해 뷰파인더에서 얼굴을 감지할 수 있습니다. nope.은 감지된 얼굴 정보를 읽거나 저장하지 않습니다."
          }
        },
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "iOS kan gezichten in de zoeker herkennen om te bepalen waarop wordt scherpgesteld. nope. leest of bewaart niet welke gezichten zijn gevonden."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "O iOS pode detectar rostos no visor para decidir onde focar. O nope. não lê nem salva quais rostos foram encontrados."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "iOS 可能会在取景器中检测人脸，以决定对焦位置。nope. 不会读取或保存检测到的人脸。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "iOS 可能會在觀景窗中偵測人臉，以決定對焦位置。nope. 不會讀取或儲存偵測到的人臉。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "nope. contains no analytics, crash-reporting or advertising code, and collects no data.": {
